            <note corresp="#d228-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d228-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Carter Library, National Security Affairs, Brzezinski Material, Subject
                    File, Box 21, Evening Reports (State), 6/79. Secret. Carter initialed the
                    memorandum and wrote: “Cy.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d228-f2" n="2" xml:id="d228-f2-content">
