            </note>
            <note corresp="#d228-f3" n="3" xml:id="d228-f3-content">
                <p> Carter wrote in the left margin: “I’ll call Murphy.” See <ref target="#d229"
                        >Document 229</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d228-f4" n="4" xml:id="d228-f4-content">
                <p> Carter placed an arrow in the left margin and wrote: “Do so.”</p>
            </note>
